    ["s0005","literal","Record its ready-reckoner construction method at left.","Record its ready-reckoner construction method below.","In treatise formula 於左 points to the following tables, not a spatial left; 'below' matches that sense and the following ready-reckoner methods.","high","applied"],
    ["s0043","literal","Every thirty years add one sign 12 degrees 27 parts; reaching 1,400 forty years, totaling seven signs 18 degrees 20 parts.","Every thirty years add one sign 12 degrees 27 parts; reaching 1,440 years, totaling seven signs 18 degrees 20 parts.","一千四百四十年 is the single numeral 1,440 years; '1,400 forty years' misreads the Chinese and obscures the total.","high","applied"],
    ["s0074","literal","Every thirty years add eight signs 27 degrees 44 parts; reaching 1,400 forty years, totaling eleven signs 6 degrees 35 parts.","Every thirty years add eight signs 27 degrees 44 parts; reaching 1,440 years, totaling eleven signs 6 degrees 35 parts.","一千四百四十年 is 1,440 years; replacing the broken '1,400 forty years' restores the correct year total.","high","applied"],
    ["s0087","literal","Every thirty years add twenty-nine parts seven seconds; 1,400 forty years, totaling twelve degrees thirty-six parts fifty-five seconds.","Every thirty years add twenty-nine parts seven seconds; 1,440 years, totaling twelve degrees thirty-six parts fifty-five seconds.","一千四百四十年 is 1,440 years; the proposed numeral matches the Chinese and the parallel idiomatic reading.","high","applied"],
    ["s0107","idiomatic","Doubled separation: full month 11°27′; short month 1 sign 17°04′; twelve-month total 11 signs 21°03′.","Doubled separation: full month 11°27′; short month 11 signs 17°04′; twelve-month total 11 signs 21°03′.","Received 小月一宮十牙度四分 is corrupt; the Siku Mingshi monthly doubled-separation entry and the parallel daily table both read 十一宮十七度四分, so short month is 11 signs 17°04′, not 1 sign.","high","applied"],
    ["s0107","literal","Doubled-separation degrees: large month eleven degrees twenty-seven parts, small month one sign seventeen degrees four parts; twelve months total eleven signs twenty-one degrees three parts.","Doubled-separation degrees: large month eleven degrees twenty-seven parts, small month eleven signs seventeen degrees four parts; twelve months total eleven signs twenty-one degrees three parts.","Same source corruption as r0005: Siku reads 小月十一宫十七度四分 for the monthly doubled-separation short-month value, so literal must say eleven signs, not one.","high","applied"],
    ["s0133","literal","Total-year ready reckoner: first year starts Metal six; six hundred years starts Sun one; every thirty years add four numbers.","Total-year ready reckoner: first year starts Metal six; six hundred years starts Sun one; every thirty years add five to the count.","Chapter 加寺數 is corrupt and 'add four numbers' is wrong, but emending to four is also wrong: Siku Mingshi reads 加五數, and Metal 6 → Sun 1 over twenty thirty-year steps requires +5 (mod 7).","medium","applied"]
